{"id":"f3790f5d9087f8dd","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/574_Justification_Logic_JD.md","title":"574 Justification Logic JD","display":"574_Justification_Logic_JD","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{574}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PVar}_{574}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PConst}_{574}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{574}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PVar}_{574}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PConst}_{574}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app}\">\\(\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app}\\)</span>。公式构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{just}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{just}\\)</span>。显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t\">\\(s+t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\cdot t\">\\(s\\cdot t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\">\\(t:A\\)</span> 分别表示相应构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与公式闭包\">2. 项与公式闭包</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{574}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{574}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pvar}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\">\\(\\operatorname{pvar}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{574}\">\\(c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{574}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\">\\(\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\">\\(s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\">\\(s\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{574}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{574}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\">\\(t:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由符号与替换\">3. 自由符号与替换</h1>\n<p>定义自由符号函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{574}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{574}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{574}:\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{574}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{574}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{574}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{574}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{574}:\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{574}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{574}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(t:A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(t:A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{574}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(s+t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(s\\cdot t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(s+t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(s\\cdot t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(t:A)=\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(t:A)=\\operatorname{TV}_{574}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{574}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项和公式均无绑定构造子。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{574}:\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{574}(U)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{574}:\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{574}(U)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义新鲜证明变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshP}_{574}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{574})\\to\\mathsf{PVar}_{574},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{574}(E)=x_m,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshP}_{574}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{574})\\to\\mathsf{PVar}_{574},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{574}(E)=x_m,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin E\\}\">\\(m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin E\\}\\)</span>。本语言无绑定构造子，因此捕获规避重命名为恒等操作。</p>\n<p>对有限支撑命题替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{574}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{574}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(B,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(t:A,\\sigma)=t:\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(B,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(t:A,\\sigma)=t:\\operatorname{SubP}_{574}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限支撑项替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\mathsf{PVar}_{574}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\">\\(\\theta:\\mathsf{PVar}_{574}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x),\\theta)=\\theta(x),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\theta)=\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x),\\theta)=\\theta(x),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\theta)=\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(s+t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(s,\\theta)+\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(t,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(s\\cdot t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(s,\\theta)\\cdot\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(t,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(s+t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(s,\\theta)+\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(t,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(s\\cdot t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(s,\\theta)\\cdot\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(t,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\theta)=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(\\bot,\\theta)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(\\neg A,\\theta)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(A,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\theta)=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(\\bot,\\theta)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(\\neg A,\\theta)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(A,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(A\\to B,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(A,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(B,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(t:A,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(t,\\theta):\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(A,\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(A\\to B,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(A,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(B,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(t:A,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{574}(t,\\theta):\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574}(A,\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,574}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,574}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{574}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{574}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{574}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{574}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{574}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{574}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{574}=\\{s:(A\\to B)\\to(t:A\\to(s\\cdot t):B):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{574}=\\{s:(A\\to B)\\to(t:A\\to(s\\cdot t):B):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{574}=\\{s:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{574}=\\{t:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{574}=\\{s:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{574}=\\{t:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{574}=\\{t:\\bot\\to\\bot:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{574}=\\{t:\\bot\\to\\bot:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxBase}_{574}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{574}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{574}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{574}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{574}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{574}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{574}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{574}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxBase}_{574}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{574}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{574}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{574}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{574}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{574}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{574}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{574}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CS}_{574}\\subseteq\\{c:A:c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{574},A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{574}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{574}=\\mathsf{AxBase}_{574}\\cup\\mathsf{CS}_{574}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CS}_{574}\\subseteq\\{c:A:c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{574},A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{574}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{574}=\\mathsf{AxBase}_{574}\\cup\\mathsf{CS}_{574}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{574}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{574}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{574}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{574}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{574}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{574}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{574}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{574}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{574}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{574}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,574}A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,574}A_i\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{574}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists ((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{574}(\\Gamma)\\ (A_{m-1}=A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{574}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists ((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{574}(\\Gamma)\\ (A_{m-1}=A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-JD-证书\">8. JD 证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"574\">\\(574\\)</span>-JD 证书为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(t)\">\\((t)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\)</span>；输出公式为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\bot\\to\\bot\">\\(t:\\bot\\to\\bot\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目加入 D 公理族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{574}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{574}\\)</span>，但不加入真实性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\\to A\">\\(t:A\\to A\\)</span>，也不加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!\">\\(!\\)</span> 项与正内省。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-证据语义载体与后承\">10. 证据语义载体与后承</h1>\n<p>原始证据模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ERaw}_{574}\n=\n\\{(W,E,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ E:W\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{574}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ERaw}_{574}\n=\n\\{(W,E,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ E:W\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{574}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{574}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{574}\">\\(M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{574}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，满足关系递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{574}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{574}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{574}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{574}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{574}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{574}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{574}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{574}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{574}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{574}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{574}B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{574}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{574}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{574}B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{574}t:A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in E(w,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{574}t:A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in E(w,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证据闭包条件为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EApp}_{574}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A,B\\ \n\\bigl(A\\to B\\in E(w,s)\\wedge A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow B\\in E(w,s\\cdot t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EApp}_{574}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A,B\\ \n\\bigl(A\\to B\\in E(w,s)\\wedge A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow B\\in E(w,s\\cdot t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ESum}_{574}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A\\ \n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,s)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr)\n\\wedge\n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ESum}_{574}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A\\ \n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,s)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr)\n\\wedge\n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ECons}_{574}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t\\ \\bot\\notin E(w,t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ECons}_{574}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t\\ \\bot\\notin E(w,t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ECS}_{574}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{574}\\ (M,w\\models_{574}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ECS}_{574}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{574}\\ (M,w\\models_{574}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>JD 证据模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EviMod}_{574}\n=\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{574}:\n\\operatorname{EApp}_{574}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ESum}_{574}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ECons}_{574}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ECS}_{574}(M)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{EviMod}_{574}\n=\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{574}:\n\\operatorname{EApp}_{574}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ESum}_{574}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ECons}_{574}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ECS}_{574}(M)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{574}^{\\mathsf e}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{574}^{\\mathsf e}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{EviMod}_{574}\">\\(M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{EviMod}_{574}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{574}B)\">\\(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{574}B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{574}A\">\\(M,w\\models_{574}A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{JD}_{574}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{574},\\mathsf{PVar}_{574},\\mathsf{PConst}_{574},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{574},\\mathsf{Frm}_{574},\\operatorname{PV}_{574},\\operatorname{TV}_{574},\\operatorname{TVF}_{574},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{574},\\operatorname{freshP}_{574},\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{574},\\operatorname{SubT}_{574},\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574},\\equiv_{\\alpha,574},\n\\mathsf{CS}_{574},\\mathsf{Ax}_{574},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{574},\\mathsf{Proof}_{574},\\vdash_{574},\n\\mathsf{ERaw}_{574},\\mathsf{EviMod}_{574},\\models_{574},\\models_{574}^{\\mathsf e}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{JD}_{574}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{574},\\mathsf{PVar}_{574},\\mathsf{PConst}_{574},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{574},\\mathsf{Frm}_{574},\\operatorname{PV}_{574},\\operatorname{TV}_{574},\\operatorname{TVF}_{574},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{574},\\operatorname{freshP}_{574},\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{574},\\operatorname{SubT}_{574},\\operatorname{SubJ}_{574},\\equiv_{\\alpha,574},\n\\mathsf{CS}_{574},\\mathsf{Ax}_{574},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{574},\\mathsf{Proof}_{574},\\vdash_{574},\n\\mathsf{ERaw}_{574},\\mathsf{EviMod}_{574},\\models_{574},\\models_{574}^{\\mathsf e}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含 JD 的显式证明项句法、公理、证明对象、可证性、证据模型、一致性语义约束和语义后承；不含可靠性证明或完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与公式闭包","text":"2. 项与公式闭包","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由符号与替换","text":"3. 自由符号与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理族","text":"4. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-JD-证书","text":"8. JD 证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-证据语义载体与后承","text":"10. 证据语义载体与后承","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{574}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PVar}_{574}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PConst}_{574}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{just}","display":false},{"tex":"s+t","display":false},{"tex":"s\\cdot t","display":false},{"tex":"t:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Term}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pvar}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"s\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{574}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{574}","displ